# Account Settings

::summary
The Account settings surface in the shell wrapper: the Settings-root Account group (Appearance, Notifications, Passkeys, Sign out) and About group (version/legal, Delete account), the Profile and Sign-in panes, and the delete-account typed-confirm modal — referenced by name, no inline copy.
::

